 "CHATTER": [
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The peasants report fewer eyes than usual."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "A raven landed on your head. It is now Royal Advisor."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The King is staring into the void. The void politely looks away."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Local man claims he \"only blinked for a second\". Eye now missing."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Royal decree: winking is now considered tax evasion."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Opticians across the kingdom report record profits."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Scarecrows unionize. Demand better hats."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Breaking: crows deny everything. Ravens refuse to comment."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "New fashion trend: eyepatches. Mostly out of necessity."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The court jester tried juggling eyes. It was a sight to behold."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Blacksmith guild unveils the spork-spoon-scoop. Nobody asked."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Village elder: \"Back in my day we had TWO eyes each.\""
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Pirates file complaint: \"Eyepatches were OUR thing.\""
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Watchtower guard reports seeing \"too much\". Promoted."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The Royal Treasury now measured in \"blinks\"."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Wizards argue whether a pupil counts as a student. Fight breaks out."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Mana prices soar after King hoards it in a sock."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Skeletons in the catacombs request eyes \"just to try them on\"."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Neighboring kingdom sends envoy. Envoy returns slightly fewer eyes."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Cathedral choir hits a high note. Seventeen windows and one bishop crack."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Scholars confirm: the moon is just a very large eye. It has been watching."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The Raven King has been named \"Most Watched Monarch\" for the 9th year."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The sun nervously asks if the Eclipse thing is \"a joke\"."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Eclipse Portal tourists report \"eyes on the other side, too, but sadder\"."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Astronomers count the stars. They are all eyes. They all blinked."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The kingdom runs out of eyes. The kingdom finds more eyes."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Reality files a formal complaint about the number of eyeballs in it."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "A raven brought back a shiny button. Kingdom-wide holiday declared."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Tip: the golden winged eye is good luck. Its cousin, the regular eye, is lunch."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "Royal astrologer predicts: eyes. Lots of eyes. Accuracy: 100%."
  },
  {
   "sec": "CHATTER",
   "id": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "en": "The King has started a book club. The book is about eyes. Everyone is in it."
  }
 ]
